From f50fc0dbfa25954b66605c129abf0861dff48d20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex local builder <codex@local.invalid>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:06:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] LOCAL: update ABI after preserving stock Rust KMI

Regenerate gki/aarch64/abi.stg with the official //common:kernel_aarch64_abi_update target after isolating SYSVIPC-only C layout from bindgen.

The update removes the accidental Rust task_struct and anonymous-union ABI drift from the prior snapshot while retaining the real C SYSVIPC layout and the init_ipc_ns/put_ipc_ns exports. The update target exits 4 because it reports the corrected ABI delta, as documented by Kleaf.

Change-Id: I4f1278f5b6d743498e3329c702cda2fd07d56f41
---
